@.str.24 = private unnamed_addr constant [308 x i8] c"The level of recursive splitting of the subvolume reconstruction process. A value of '3' means that a 3x3x3 regular space subdivision is created and the reconstruction process generate 8 matching meshes. It is useful for reconsruction objects at a very high resolution. Default value (1) means no splitting.\00", align 1
@.str.25 = private unnamed_addr constant [9 x i8] c"geodesic\00", align 1
@.str.26 = private unnamed_addr constant [19 x i8] c"Geodesic Weighting\00", align 1
@.str.27 = private unnamed_addr constant [208 x i8] c"The influence of each range map is weighted with its geodesic distance from the borders. In this way when two (or more ) range maps overlaps their contribution blends smoothly hiding possible misalignments. \00", align 1
